			],
			"Message": "refactor(Output): Reformat build configuration and plugin pipeline for readability\n\nReformat the entire Output element's ESBuild configuration, plugin definitions, and polyfill scripts. Apply consistent whitespace, indentation, and array formatting across all `.js` and `.ts` files in `Configuration/` and `Source/` to align with the project's PascalCase naming conventions and readability standards.\n\nKey modifications:\n- Unbundle minified one-liners in `Configuration/ESBuild/` exclusion patterns and plugin transforms into multi-line structures for clarity.\n- Refactor `Source/Plugin/Index.ts` import statements and the `BuildPipeline` composition logic.\n- Update PostHog telemetry injection in `Source/ESBuild/Output.ts` to include environment variables `Capture` and `Report` as kill switches.\n- Reformat polyfill implementations (`ChildProcess`, `FileSystem`, `IPCRenderer`, etc.) to improve code density and maintenance.\n- Update `CHANGELOG.md` to reflect v2.2 correctness pass details.\n\nThe logical behavior of the build pipeline remains unchanged; the commit solely addresses source formatting and documentation consistency.",
